Z||000000||jhogans||12-03-1999||06:54 PM||||Fiero Brothers / Sisters,<P>You all know that I've been looking for a Fiero.  I found one.<P>I have an opportunity to purchase a 1986 Fiero GT with 90000 miles from a Cadillac Dealership for $2600 after I talked them down from their original price of $4995.  It has all of the options, power windows, locks, mirrors, tape deck w/eq, subwoofer (sounds blown), sunroof, etc.  <P>Is this a good price for this car or should I try to haggle them further.  Thanks for any info.||||reg||5
